 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Roughly at eye level, or a bit lower if you lean on it while you type. Too high and it' a strain after a while. About two hands on a full length wall, or up to your chest if you lean on it. Too far away and you strain your neck and shoulders. Then use a stand with a wide armrest and it rests on your lap. Lots of people find this the most comfortable. Nice. A tall chair or stool can save your back if you spend long hours typed.",
